      <abstract>
        <para>
          &suselinux;&nbsp;16.1 provides integrated real-time capabilities. To confirm that a
          server can meet real-time deadlines, measure its latency with the hardware latency
          detector and with <systemitem>cyclictest</systemitem>. The hardware latency detector
          exposes delays caused by firmware and hardware. The <systemitem>cyclictest</systemitem>
          tool adds the scheduling overhead of the operating system to the measurement. This
          article explains how to prepare the platform, run both tools on &suselinux;&nbsp;16.1 and
          interpret the results.
        </para>
      </abstract>
